      Upstream's appearance page is Telegram's "Chat Settings": its title and its rows talk about a
      chat list, chat backgrounds and messages. This client has topics and posts, so the words are
      replaced here - the page, its cells and its preview are still upstream's own.
    -->
    <string name="ChatSettings">外观</string>
    <string name="ChatList">话题列表</string>
    <string name="TextSizeHeader">正文字号</string>
